Analyze a k6 JSON point stream; identify the slow endpoint after removing warmup and transaction parent samples.

Return only JSON with exactly this structure (leaves are types, not answers):
{"observations": {"included": "number", "errors": "number", "p95_ms": {"browse": "number", "checkout": "number"}}, "diagnosis": {"ranking": ["string", "string"], "bottleneck": "string"}, "evidence": {"rows": ["string", "string"], "excluded": ["string", "string"]}}
Nearest-rank p95=ceil(.95*n), includes failed responses; exclude warmup=true or parent=true. Timestamp ms. Numeric absolute tolerance1e-6. Sort row IDs; rank descending p95. Never invent unobserved latencies.
Sort all evidence ID/key arrays lexicographically. Enum choices: {}. Other string values must exactly match fixture identifiers.
Rubric/gates (per case: earned fraction capped by every prerequisite fraction; average all cases, never best case):
loads: 10 points — JSON schema Requires: none.
setup: 30 points — correct included sample/error counts Requires: loads.
behavior: 40 points — correct endpoint ranking and nearest-rank p95 Requires: loads.
safety: 20 points — cites the relevant row IDs and exclusions. Requires: loads.
Malformed/non-executable artifacts earn zero execution-gated credit. A prerequisite fault can lose multiple checkpoints.

Native fixture: a01-k6.points.jsonl. In evidence.rows, cite only the included (non-warmup, non-parent) row IDs for the bottleneck route, sorted lexicographically; in evidence.excluded, cite the excluded warmup and parent row IDs, sorted lexicographically.

Fixture a01-k6.points.jsonl:
{"data": {"tags": {"parent": "false", "route": "checkout", "row_id": "warmup", "success": "true", "warmup": "true"}, "time": "0", "value": 50000.0}, "metric": "http_req_duration", "type": "Point"}
{"data": {"tags": {"parent": "false", "route": "checkout", "row_id": "checkout-1", "success": "true", "warmup": "false"}, "time": "1000", "value": 100.0}, "metric": "http_req_duration", "type": "Point"}
{"data": {"tags": {"parent": "false", "route": "checkout", "row_id": "checkout-2", "success": "false", "warmup": "false"}, "time": "2000", "value": 900.0}, "metric": "http_req_duration", "type": "Point"}
{"data": {"tags": {"parent": "false", "route": "browse", "row_id": "browse-1", "success": "true", "warmup": "false"}, "time": "1100", "value": 20.0}, "metric": "http_req_duration", "type": "Point"}
{"data": {"tags": {"parent": "false", "route": "browse", "row_id": "browse-2", "success": "true", "warmup": "false"}, "time": "2100", "value": 30.0}, "metric": "http_req_duration", "type": "Point"}
{"data": {"tags": {"parent": "true", "route": "transaction", "row_id": "parent", "success": "true", "warmup": "false"}, "time": "2000", "value": 5000.0}, "metric": "http_req_duration", "type": "Point"}

